PTX CoWR+async-bulk+same-cta
"One thread stores to shared memory s with a generic store, copies s to global g with cp.async.bulk (async proxy), waits for the copy, and reads g. No proxy fence between the store and the copy."
{
s=0;
g=0;
P0:r0=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0                ;
 st.weak.shared::cta s, 1                ;
 cp.async.bulk.global.shared::cta g, s   ;
 cp.async.bulk.commit_group              ;
 cp.async.bulk.wait_group 0              ;
 ld.weak.global r0, g                    ;
exists
(P0:r0 == 0)
